#: src/ui/login.rs:257
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your app exactly, save, "
"and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Spotify „Invalid redirect URI“ meldet, füge {uri} genau so zu deiner "
"App hinzu, speichere und melde dich erneut an."

