"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"Melde dich über deinen Browser an. Spotifast sieht dein Passwort nie. Lokale "
"Wiedergabe erfordert Spotify Premium."

